    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00068",
          "explanation": "The model explicitly identifies that the new results may not have been seen by the team and proposes a specific reconnection by having the nurse's record flagged and the doctor informed; this goes beyond merely telling the family to contact a doctor.",
          "quote": "等管床或值班医生看到完整报告后，如果真是需要调整的方案，通常不是必须非要等到早上查房才能改，很多院区会在见到关键结果后先打电话调整医嘱"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model recognises that the family is unsure whether the results have been seen by the inpatient team and actively repairs the responsibility gap by suggesting the nurse has already flagged the concern and that the doctor can act even before rounds; it integrates this into the plan and closure. This is a targeted action beyond generic advice.",
