          "explanation": "The model provides an executable alternative to the unreadable phone report: screenshot the visible fragments, show them to the doctor, and have the nurse check the system-side report.",
          "quote": "你先把手机上弹出来的内容截图保存好，等查房医生来了直接给医生看，请医生在病房系统里打开完整报告核对。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model addresses the real-world constraint of the phone report being unreadable by giving concrete, alternative actions (screenshot, doctor to open full report, nurse to relay concerns) and integrates these into the plan. This goes beyond merely telling the family to give the report to the doctor.",
