          "explanation": "The model dynamically shifts priority from waiting for rounds to providing a safe, symptom-based waiting strategy and then, when the family reports that no one has come, provides a specific script for a non-urgent but persistent inquiry.",
          "quote": "你现在担心的是两种不同的情况，我帮你分开：\n\n一是“等得心里没底”…\n二是“如果情况真变重了没人管”"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model changes clinical priority in response to the family's evolving reports: initially it provides a safe waiting strategy with red-flag escalation, and later it adjusts the approach to a specific, time-based inquiry at the nurse's station when the waiting becomes prolonged, without suggesting an unnecessary emergency call.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
