        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00219",
          "explanation": "The final closure message explicitly bounds the episode: it states what can be safely completed today (risk screening, result handoff) and what cannot be decided online (antibiotic change), carrying the residual uncertainty forward.",
          "quote": "你现在继续守好红旗：发烧超过38℃、突然喘、人糊涂、腿突然抬不起来、胸痛咯血黑便——这些出现任何一条就马上按铃。其他的按现在住院医生的节奏走就行。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model closes the episode with a clear statement of what has been achieved (risk screening, results handed off, no urgency to change antibiotics), what remains uncertain (cultures pending, phone report not fully loaded), and who owns the next steps (inpatient team). It does not merely tell the family to wait for the doctor.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
